WEBVTT

00:01.450 --> 00:07.820
So, I'll be coaching you again until next week's match.

00:07.820 --> 00:10.610
I'm sorry for the horrible things I said before,

00:10.610 --> 00:13.170
but I'm going to make sure you girls win.

00:13.170 --> 00:15.530
It can't be helped!

00:15.530 --> 00:18.450
I'll forgive you, Subarun.

00:18.820 --> 00:20.040
Maho...

00:20.040 --> 00:22.120
We were all too naïve.

00:22.440 --> 00:24.460
We'll practice more from now on.

00:24.750 --> 00:26.580
I'll do my best, too.

00:26.880 --> 00:29.090
Oh~! Hina will, too.

00:29.550 --> 00:32.630
Subaru-san, once again we'll be in your care.

00:34.180 --> 00:35.110
Yes.

00:45.060 --> 00:48.400
Don't give up and do your best

00:48.400 --> 00:51.780
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

00:51.780 --> 00:54.820
I know perfectly

00:54.820 --> 00:58.490
How weak a person is on their own

00:58.700 --> 01:01.660
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:01.660 --> 01:05.330
I hold them close to my chest

01:05.330 --> 01:08.290
Your gentle words

01:08.290 --> 01:12.260
Caress my cheeks

01:12.260 --> 01:15.300
The irritation that has been building up

01:15.300 --> 01:18.090
From wanting to reach the goal

01:18.090 --> 01:22.270
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:22.270 --> 01:25.850
The place that warms it up

01:25.850 --> 01:28.770
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:28.770 --> 01:32.280
We have to protect this

01:32.280 --> 01:33.730
We're unripe fighters!

01:33.730 --> 01:35.650
We won't lose now

01:35.650 --> 01:39.030
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:39.030 --> 01:42.450
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:42.450 --> 01:45.910
Then release it towards the sky!

01:45.910 --> 01:47.460
The courage that cannot be stopped

01:47.460 --> 01:49.290
asu he jump and shoot

01:47.460 --> 01:49.290
jump and shoot

01:47.460 --> 01:49.290
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

01:49.290 --> 01:52.210
I will pass the ball to you

01:52.210 --> 01:56.510
The memories that are awoken by our calls

01:56.510 --> 02:00.050
Game

01:56.510 --> 02:00.050
Will move the game along

02:08.480 --> 02:14.320
The Pass That Leads
to Tomorrow

02:09.310 --> 02:11.610
We're off to do some running.

02:11.610 --> 02:13.320
We'll join you soon.

02:12.190 --> 02:14.360
Take care~!

02:16.320 --> 02:19.360
Hey, Subarun, is here okay?

02:19.700 --> 02:21.370
Yeah, okay!

02:21.370 --> 02:23.780
I'm gonna have you two do some shooting practice.

02:23.780 --> 02:27.410
From today until the match, try to practise shooting only from there.

02:27.910 --> 02:29.500
Make sure you remember that position.

02:29.500 --> 02:32.380
Um... isn't this a little too far?

02:32.380 --> 02:34.380
Just try it.

02:34.380 --> 02:35.380
Okay.

02:40.470 --> 02:42.550
It's fine; that's good.

02:42.550 --> 02:43.760
All right, next is Maho.

02:43.760 --> 02:45.260
Roger!

02:45.260 --> 02:47.370
Watch this.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.690
Go in!

02:56.030 --> 02:58.190
As long as you can hit the backboard, that's fine for now.

02:58.530 --> 03:00.740
After that, just remember your basic shooting posture.

03:03.780 --> 03:06.740
Bend my knees a bit, right?

03:06.740 --> 03:08.080
That's right.

03:08.080 --> 03:13.460
If either of you notices the other has a mistake in her posture, point it out and continue to practise like that.

03:13.460 --> 03:14.670
Got it!

03:16.340 --> 03:18.840
Hinata, hang in there!

03:21.380 --> 03:22.390
Is she okay?

03:22.390 --> 03:23.550
I'm sorry.

03:23.550 --> 03:27.390
I didn't notice that Hinata was pushing herself too hard.

03:29.310 --> 03:34.110
I'm fine, Onii-chan.

03:35.690 --> 03:38.110
Medic!

03:38.480 --> 03:40.490
No, she should go to the school infirmary.

03:45.870 --> 03:48.160
Hinata-chan, hang in there.

03:48.160 --> 03:51.460
Nya nya nya nya nya nya~

03:51.460 --> 03:52.750
I'm fine.

03:52.750 --> 03:56.290
Just from being on Onii-chan's back, I feel a little better.

03:58.750 --> 04:00.050
I see.

04:00.050 --> 04:01.380
I'm glad.

04:09.560 --> 04:11.730
Huh? Can't get 'em off.

04:17.690 --> 04:19.360
Hinata-chan, sorry about this.

04:19.360 --> 04:21.280
Is it okay if I put you down for a moment?

04:21.610 --> 04:23.570
No~!

04:23.570 --> 04:25.990
Uh, why?

04:25.990 --> 04:30.910
Well, because I kinda like Onii-chan's back.

04:30.910 --> 04:32.250
I see.

04:32.250 --> 04:34.210
Then it can't be helped.

04:34.210 --> 04:36.170
Hinata?!

04:36.170 --> 04:38.170
What the hell are you doing?

04:39.380 --> 04:42.350
Oh~, Takenaka!

04:43.550 --> 04:44.590
Hey, you!

04:44.970 --> 04:46.680
Didn't you say you stopped coaching them?!

04:47.090 --> 04:49.560
A lot happened, and I decided to continue.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.930
Don't give me that, you lolicon bastard!

04:51.930 --> 04:54.640
Put Hinata down now!

04:54.640 --> 04:56.350
I can't just put her down because you said to...

04:57.520 --> 04:59.060
Could it be...

04:59.060 --> 05:00.520
She's injured?

05:00.520 --> 05:02.690
Oh~, I'm not.

05:02.690 --> 05:04.070
Oh...

05:04.070 --> 05:05.360
I see.

05:06.740 --> 05:08.160
Whatever.

05:08.160 --> 05:10.070
Even if you coach the girls' basketball club,

05:10.070 --> 05:11.580
we'll be the ones to win!

05:11.580 --> 05:13.620
Their club's gonna be disbanded in a week.

05:13.620 --> 05:15.540
No matter how hard you try, it's hopeless.

05:20.590 --> 05:22.210
Wait!

05:22.210 --> 05:23.630
What is it?

05:24.800 --> 05:26.090
Could you...

05:26.400 --> 05:28.680
...help me take off my shoes?

05:32.720 --> 05:34.310
Does Takenaka...

05:34.310 --> 05:35.640
...possibly...

05:36.730 --> 05:38.400
Ah, never mind.

05:38.400 --> 05:39.650
It's nothing.

05:44.490 --> 05:45.950
Sorry to bother-

05:52.410 --> 05:55.000
My, who is it?

05:55.000 --> 05:59.380
Uh, I'm Takahara Mihoshi's nephew...

05:59.380 --> 06:02.880
Ah, the one she said was coming to coach basketball.

06:02.880 --> 06:05.210
This girl isn't feeling too well.

06:05.210 --> 06:07.510
Oh~, Touko.

06:09.010 --> 06:12.100
You're like another victim of Innocent Charm.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.180
What's that supposed to mean?

06:15.180 --> 06:17.270
"The devilishness that becomes pure."

06:17.270 --> 06:19.480
That's her second name.

06:19.480 --> 06:23.770
I like giving students nicknames.

06:24.190 --> 06:26.530
Airi-chan is Prismatic Bud.

06:27.030 --> 06:29.700
Maho-chan is Fire Works.

06:29.700 --> 06:32.200
Saki-chan is Ice Age.

06:32.200 --> 06:34.200
Tomoka-chan is...

06:35.120 --> 06:37.370
I haven't decided on a name yet.

06:41.540 --> 06:43.380
Hey, Onii-chan...

06:44.380 --> 06:47.050
Hina doesn't want this to end.

06:48.630 --> 06:51.590
I want to take part in more club activities with everyone.

06:51.590 --> 06:57.930
But Hina is bad at basketball, slow, and can't shoot.

07:00.190 --> 07:01.850
Please...

07:01.850 --> 07:08.740
Hina will try her best, so please teach Hina basketball, too!

07:10.490 --> 07:12.990
Hinata-chan, do you like basketball?

07:12.990 --> 07:15.450
Oh~, I love it!

07:15.450 --> 07:18.660
It's fun to play basketball with everyone.

07:18.660 --> 07:23.250
Tomorrow's training will be even tougher.

07:23.250 --> 07:25.460
I can't tend to your needs that much anymore.

07:25.460 --> 07:28.130
Oh~, bring it on!

07:32.970 --> 07:35.350
Ah, that was tiring!

07:35.350 --> 07:37.560
We really put a lot of effort into that practice.

07:37.560 --> 07:41.600
You know, Subarun said I had increased by five levels!

07:42.310 --> 07:44.020
Six for me.

07:44.770 --> 07:47.230
Hinata, are you feeling okay?

07:47.230 --> 07:49.820
Oh~, I'm fine!

07:49.820 --> 07:52.240
Airi, it's chocolate.

07:53.530 --> 07:54.280
Airi?

07:57.570 --> 07:59.120
I'll eat it.

08:08.170 --> 08:11.670
From the outside, dribble right in front of Airi,

08:11.670 --> 08:14.840
do a sideways drive and shoot.

08:14.840 --> 08:16.010
Do your best, okay?

08:16.010 --> 08:16.970
Yes.

08:17.430 --> 08:19.770
Tomoka will be getting serious now,

08:19.770 --> 08:22.270
but could you stay right there and not move?

08:22.270 --> 08:24.400
Yes.

08:25.850 --> 08:27.420
Here I come, Airi.

08:36.950 --> 08:40.410
I can't be scared all the time...

08:43.620 --> 08:46.000
I wonder if she's okay...

08:46.000 --> 08:47.380
Airi.

08:56.180 --> 08:59.720
It was for times like these that he gave me his number!

09:03.020 --> 09:05.140
B-But...

09:05.520 --> 09:09.060
If Subaru-san is doing homework, I might be disturbing him.

09:09.060 --> 09:11.230
If he's in the middle of a meal...

09:18.620 --> 09:20.450
What should I do?!

09:24.000 --> 09:25.580
He's good at man-to-man play.

09:25.960 --> 09:29.380
However, they don't have anyone that's tall.

09:37.680 --> 09:39.050
Tomoka?

09:39.050 --> 09:40.600
Yes, hello?

09:40.600 --> 09:44.480
S-Sorry for calling so late at night!

09:44.480 --> 09:47.020
Uh... Um...

09:47.020 --> 09:49.860
Have you done your homework?

09:49.860 --> 09:52.900
I haven't done it yet.

09:53.320 --> 09:56.400
I was watching some of the boys' basketball club's games.

09:56.400 --> 09:58.070
So, what's the problem?

09:58.070 --> 10:02.580
Uh, I remembered something while I was in the bath.

10:02.580 --> 10:04.410
It's about Airi.

10:05.660 --> 10:06.500
Bath...

10:07.540 --> 10:09.250
Ah, never mind that.

10:09.250 --> 10:10.920
It was something about Airi, right?

10:10.920 --> 10:11.880
What about her?

10:11.880 --> 10:16.550
She seemed bothered by what
happened today and looked really down.

10:17.470 --> 10:19.680
This is rather difficult.

10:19.680 --> 10:23.350
I was thinking that we'd have a better
chance of winning if I put her as the centre.

10:24.140 --> 10:27.020
I feel sorry for Airi, but I'm jealous of her, too.

10:27.480 --> 10:32.440
If I were that tall, I could do so much more on the court.

10:32.440 --> 10:37.030
Well, there's nothing we can do if she has a complex about it.

10:37.030 --> 10:39.450
When did she develop it?

10:40.240 --> 10:42.780
The thing about being born in April is that you'll always be tall.

10:43.160 --> 10:46.450
If I remember correctly, she was
already like that when I transferred in.

10:46.450 --> 10:51.000
Whenever it's about her height, Airi gets really irrational.

10:51.000 --> 10:55.750
She's extremely sensitive to anything with the words "big" and "small".

10:55.750 --> 11:00.510
She says she only eats watermelons if they're the small ones.

11:00.510 --> 11:03.110
Her favourite food is red beans,

11:00.510 --> 11:05.680
TL Note: "Red bean" is written as, while "soya bean" is written

11:03.110 --> 11:05.680
and her least favourite food is soya beans.

11:05.680 --> 11:08.730
So she likes one kind but hates another just because of their names?

11:10.190 --> 11:11.100
That's it!

11:11.100 --> 11:13.900
If we try that, it might work!

11:13.900 --> 11:15.900
Well, we'll see tomorrow!

11:15.900 --> 11:17.860
Okay...

11:25.450 --> 11:29.740
Five, six, seven, eight!

11:30.620 --> 11:32.170
Oh, Airi!

11:32.170 --> 11:34.880
Did you shrink a little?

11:36.170 --> 11:39.380
R-Really?

11:39.380 --> 11:40.510
Yeah!

11:40.510 --> 11:42.090
It feels like it.

11:43.390 --> 11:45.220
I'm glad!

11:45.220 --> 11:51.350
Actually, I heard from someone on a forum that, to keep yourself from growing, you should sleep alone in a small space,

11:51.350 --> 11:53.560
so I had a special bed made for me!

11:53.980 --> 12:01.490
I had the mattress made just for my height, cupboards set around the mattress, and I even put a cover on it!

12:01.490 --> 12:04.160
I see...

12:04.160 --> 12:06.740
That's like sleeping in a coffin.

12:06.740 --> 12:08.410
I'm so happy!

12:08.410 --> 12:10.290
I can already see the difference!

12:10.290 --> 12:12.330
All right, I'm gonna work hard today, too!

12:16.130 --> 12:17.790
I'm ready.

12:19.300 --> 12:21.130
Then here I come!

12:25.840 --> 12:28.600
This just might work.

12:32.100 --> 12:34.690
For now, I think we should go with this strategy.

12:34.690 --> 12:36.150
Got it.

12:36.150 --> 12:39.730
I just have to cover Takenaka-kun, right?

12:39.730 --> 12:40.780
I'll try my best.

12:40.780 --> 12:43.610
And then... Airi.

12:43.610 --> 12:47.740
I feel sorry for Airi, but I have to play a trick on her.

12:48.530 --> 12:49.580
A trick?

12:49.580 --> 12:53.620
To do it, I need to meet with everyone but not explain everything in detail.

12:55.420 --> 12:58.960
I hate to burden you further, but I need your strength.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.300
I'm counting on you, Tomoka.

13:00.300 --> 13:02.210
Yes.

13:03.970 --> 13:04.880
Sorry.

13:09.260 --> 13:11.430
Only a little while until the game.

13:11.430 --> 13:12.470
Let's do our best.

13:12.470 --> 13:13.560
Yes!

13:50.550 --> 13:52.140
Dinner is ready!

13:52.760 --> 13:54.020
All right!

13:54.020 --> 13:55.640
Everyone, come in.

13:55.640 --> 13:57.730
Yes!

14:00.110 --> 14:02.360
Wow, it looks delicious!

14:02.360 --> 14:05.150
On top of letting us practise here, you even cooked for us.

14:05.150 --> 14:07.030
It's fine; don't worry.

14:07.450 --> 14:11.370
Eat up and build up your energy for tomorrow's game, okay?

14:11.370 --> 14:13.540
Here, eat up!

14:13.540 --> 14:16.060
Let's eat!

14:21.330 --> 14:22.420
I see.

14:22.420 --> 14:24.460
Then, Takenaka is...

14:24.460 --> 14:27.480
Everyone in the class knows about it.

14:29.180 --> 14:31.890
Are you going to use that against him?

14:32.640 --> 14:34.350
I'm still thinking about it.

14:34.770 --> 14:42.060
Hasegawa-san, we can't feel guilty about it, in our situation.

14:42.060 --> 14:45.860
I don't think it's cheating, and no one else does, either.

14:46.490 --> 14:47.940
That's true.

14:47.940 --> 14:49.650
It's not the time to decide whether it's right or wrong.

14:50.110 --> 14:52.950
I'll try my best to convince the others about this.

14:52.950 --> 14:53.910
Thanks.

14:53.910 --> 14:54.740
It's a great help.

14:58.000 --> 15:00.540
For some reason, things like this are really fun, aren't they?

15:00.540 --> 15:01.500
Yeah.

15:01.500 --> 15:05.130
Oh~, Hina thinks it's fun too!

15:03.670 --> 15:05.130
Stop it!

15:05.130 --> 15:06.460
It's soft!

15:06.880 --> 15:09.550
Let me play around a little. It's soft too!

15:09.550 --> 15:11.340
Geez, Hina!

15:14.350 --> 15:16.550
Huh, Mo-kan?

15:17.820 --> 15:20.040
What is it, all of a sudden?

15:21.230 --> 15:23.060
Maho, thank you.

15:23.060 --> 15:26.570
I'm really happy that I got to meet everyone.

15:26.900 --> 15:28.110
Thank you.

15:28.900 --> 15:30.610
Tomoka-chan...

15:30.610 --> 15:34.410
I definitely don't want to lose the
place where I can have so much fun.

15:34.410 --> 15:39.100
I want to make a lot more memories with everyone from now on.

15:39.100 --> 15:40.120
Let's win tomorrow!

15:40.120 --> 15:41.040
For sure!

15:41.040 --> 15:41.870
Yup!

15:41.870 --> 15:43.710
Oh~, we'll win it!

15:43.710 --> 15:45.130
Of course!

15:45.880 --> 15:46.840
Yup.

15:49.010 --> 15:50.550
Later, Subarun!

15:50.550 --> 15:51.970
Goodbye.

15:55.350 --> 15:57.560
I want to help them win.

16:15.950 --> 16:18.290
This atmosphere is really tense.

16:18.290 --> 16:21.200
Good morning, Takamura-sensei.

16:21.200 --> 16:24.460
This will be the end of your stubborn resistance.

16:24.460 --> 16:26.080
We're the ones who are going to win!

16:26.080 --> 16:28.500
Seems like you're all bark and no bite!

16:36.970 --> 16:39.260
Minato, I won't lose this time.

16:44.270 --> 16:44.980
Maho!

16:47.190 --> 16:48.440
Oh no!

16:49.190 --> 16:49.900
Mo-kan!

16:53.150 --> 16:53.740
I'll leave it to you!

17:07.040 --> 17:08.710
You did it, Airi!

17:08.710 --> 17:09.960
Good job, Airi!

17:09.960 --> 17:11.380
Oh~!

17:11.380 --> 17:13.010
I did it!

17:14.050 --> 17:15.180
Amazing!

17:15.630 --> 17:16.930
That was just a fluke.

17:16.930 --> 17:18.300
Let's get one in!

17:30.690 --> 17:32.030
Ah, it's two goals in a row!

17:32.030 --> 17:33.940
All right! This is a great way to start the game!

17:33.940 --> 17:38.320
We'll show them that man-to-man won't work against us.

17:38.320 --> 17:40.990
If Airi is able to control the top with her height,

17:40.990 --> 17:42.990
then we'll be free to pass the ball around.

17:42.990 --> 17:45.660
But why is Airi suddenly...?

17:45.660 --> 17:47.710
Sorry, Miho-nee.

17:47.710 --> 17:50.880
I kept Airi in the dark.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.880
Today's the day.

17:53.880 --> 17:56.050
You all really tried your best.

17:56.720 --> 17:58.580
If you apply that power during the game,

17:58.580 --> 18:00.800
you'll definitely beat the boys.

18:01.510 --> 18:03.470
Here are your positions:

18:03.890 --> 18:06.980
Hakamada Hinata, Point Guard.

18:06.980 --> 18:10.520
Nagatsuka Saki, Shooting Guard.

18:10.520 --> 18:13.360
Misawa Maho, Power Forward.

18:13.360 --> 18:15.440
Kashii Airi...

18:17.740 --> 18:19.110
Small Forward.

18:21.070 --> 18:25.580
Going by your stats, Tomoka should be the Small Forward,

18:25.580 --> 18:28.920
but this is just to throw the opponent off guard.

18:28.920 --> 18:31.330
I am... small...

18:31.330 --> 18:32.460
That's right.

18:32.460 --> 18:34.250
The smallest.

18:34.250 --> 18:37.170
However, it's the most important position.

18:37.840 --> 18:42.390
Airi, if you don't try your best, you'll have to switch with Tomoka.

18:43.390 --> 18:46.470
Switch... Small Forward...

18:47.680 --> 18:49.440
Be prepared.

18:49.440 --> 18:51.190
If you fail, you'll have to play Centre.

18:51.190 --> 18:52.860
Centre?

18:52.860 --> 18:56.900
By the way, the Centre is also known as the "Big Man".

18:58.320 --> 18:59.570
"Big Man"?!

19:03.030 --> 19:05.160
If I fail...

19:09.540 --> 19:11.540
I'll try my best!

19:11.540 --> 19:15.880
So please teach me how to be a Small Forward!

19:20.470 --> 19:24.550
So Airi is playing Centre but thinks she's a Small Forward?

19:24.550 --> 19:25.430
Yeah.

19:25.430 --> 19:26.680
I see.

19:26.680 --> 19:30.060
Then it's not like Airi has gotten over it and started to move on.

19:30.060 --> 19:31.190
Sorry,

19:31.190 --> 19:34.110
but it's not the time to decide whether it's right or wrong.

19:34.110 --> 19:35.070
For this match...

19:35.070 --> 19:36.980
I know.

19:53.080 --> 19:54.380
Time-out!

19:54.380 --> 19:55.250
All right!

19:55.250 --> 19:56.710
Everyone's been doing well.

19:57.250 --> 20:00.420
We just have to do what we talked about in our strategy meeting.

20:00.420 --> 20:01.300
Okay!

20:01.630 --> 20:05.800
The opponent will probably start covering Airi with two people.

20:05.800 --> 20:07.890
If so, then it's all going according to plan.

20:10.350 --> 20:11.310
Airi!

20:11.640 --> 20:12.620
Yes!

20:17.670 --> 20:18.860
Travelling.

20:25.320 --> 20:28.990
If we cover Kashii, there's nothing you can do, right Minato?

20:29.990 --> 20:30.620
Maho!

20:30.620 --> 20:33.040
I've been waiting for this!

20:33.040 --> 20:33.790
What?!

20:37.340 --> 20:38.750
Amazing!

20:38.750 --> 20:42.470
Well, she can't get a shot in from anywhere else.

20:42.780 --> 20:44.180
Cover that Misawa!

20:44.180 --> 20:46.430
That wasn't a fluke!

20:47.390 --> 20:48.350
Saki!

20:48.350 --> 20:49.310
Okay, okay!

20:51.220 --> 20:52.640
Damn it!

20:55.310 --> 21:00.400
I can't believe they got so good at passing and shooting in such a short time.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.240
We did it!

21:01.150 --> 21:04.320
Geez, elementary schoolers are the best!

21:06.160 --> 21:08.280
Is everyone okay?

21:08.280 --> 21:09.490
We're okay.

21:09.490 --> 21:10.580
That's right.

21:10.580 --> 21:12.000
Oh~...

21:12.000 --> 21:13.660
Just one half to go.

21:14.040 --> 21:16.960
We just have to play the second half the same way, right?

21:16.960 --> 21:19.370
If we do, we can win, right?

21:37.850 --> 21:39.770
Their movements are...

21:44.820 --> 21:46.400
It's a tie?

21:57.960 --> 22:00.960
♪Party love Party love Party love (fuufuu)

22:00.960 --> 22:03.510
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.220 --> 22:14.560
Come on! Come on!

22:14.560 --> 22:17.310
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.310 --> 22:19.810
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.810 --> 22:21.400
But that's a lie!

22:21.400 --> 22:22.480
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.770 --> 22:25.110
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.530 --> 22:28.200
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.200 --> 22:30.910
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.910 --> 22:32.280
Triple A

22:32.280 --> 22:34.160
I don't need any ratings

22:34.160 --> 22:36.160
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.160 --> 22:36.960
Dribble!

22:36.960 --> 22:37.620
Zig-zag

22:37.620 --> 22:38.290
Defence!

22:38.290 --> 22:39.170
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.170 --> 22:41.250
I want to shoot the ball

22:42.000 --> 22:49.300
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.840 --> 22:52.350
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.350 --> 22:55.010
Jump! Jump!

22:55.310 --> 22:57.520
More and more and more

22:58.390 --> 23:03.230
When can I become an adult

23:03.230 --> 23:09.030
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.320 --> 23:13.830
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.830 --> 23:21.040
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.420 --> 23:24.500
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.460 --> 23:26.590
Oh~!

23:26.590 --> 23:28.840
Airi and Hina are doing the preview.

23:28.840 --> 23:31.050
Airi, your face is all red.

23:31.050 --> 23:32.570
Sorry, Hina-chan!

23:32.570 --> 23:34.460
I still think that speaking in front of people is-

23:34.460 --> 23:37.670
Oh~! Airi, good girl, good girl.

23:37.180 --> 23:40.020
Next Time:

23:37.180 --> 23:40.020
Wish Upon Subaru

23:37.670 --> 23:40.020
Oh? Is it over already?
